  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5840</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5601</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うぅ〜、寒っ、寒っ！
冬山では、皮下脂肪が
プニプニの人がうらやまし〜なぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Brrr, so cold... SO COLD!
It's times like these I really envy those
with a bit more meat on their bones, y'knooow?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6444</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5602</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ〜ら、&lt;Beryl&gt;
なんで私を見るのかしら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, whatever could you
be looking at me for?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6772</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5603</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>別にぃ〜♪　&lt;Ines&gt;は
カルシウムが足りないんじゃない？
……脂肪はタプタプだけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, no reason! ♪
Say, do you get enough calcium in your diet?
...Looks like you're good for fat, though!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7080</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5604</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……なんですって？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...What was that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7824</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5605</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Ines&gt;、自分の両手を
握ると体脂肪率が測定できる。
使用するか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Ines&gt;, if you take my hands
I am able to determine your BMI.
Shall I scan you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8372</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5606</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>え、遠慮します！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I-I think I'll pass!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8824</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;C5606b&gt;&lt;Kunzite&gt;の手に
そんな秘密機能が……!?
……気をつけなきゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Who knew &lt;Kunzite&gt;'s hands
had that kind of power?
I'd better be more careful...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
